WEBVTT

00:06:59.863 --> 00:07:04.997
Is this only for disruptors who start
from scratch? I don't think so.

00:07:05.430 --> 00:07:11.597
It's pretty amazing. If you could get
companies to use their assets to disrupt,

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:15.330
take Unilever with their sustainable
living program.

00:07:15.963 --> 00:07:20.397
So when Paul Polman took
over as CEO in 2009,

00:07:20.697 --> 00:07:27.197
he had this vision of harmonising profits
and environmental sustainability

00:07:27.197 --> 00:07:30.963
and they completely transformed their
business model portfolio.